(rocket-burn-runtime-harness)
*title Rocket burn runtime harness
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=0.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=0.0 zdt=0.0 time=0.0 mass=620.0
  *file rocket-burn-runtime.dat time thrust mdot wt xecfcdt
  *segment 1 burn
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *prop thrust=(constant-thrust) mdot=(burn-mdot)
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end

